Error [E0212]: `right` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `result` is still looking into it
  --> multi_source_returned_aggregate_still_blocks_owner_invalidation_2.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     right.push(11)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `right[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `right`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [E0224]: This call writes `right`, but `right` has no `&` mark
  --> multi_source_returned_aggregate_still_blocks_owner_invalidation_2.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     right.push(11)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&right`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224
